But really, how likely is it that you can get a full set of armor?  You
are assuming that a coaligned altar on DL1 equates directly to that; I'm
telling you that you are making a lot of assumptions that are completely
unwarranted about what "random" will give you.

For example, say you get three helmets and two cloaks out of your first
five sacrifices.  Sure, that's fabulous, you got a couple good items
